          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Nelson Mandela</strong><br>\nNelson Mandela was born on July 18, 1918, in the village of Mvezo in South Africa. He belonged to the Thembu royal family and his father was a local chief and counselor to the monarch. Mandela's early life was steeped in tradition and cultural heritage, but it was also marked by the colonial oppression of the time. He attended a Methodist school where he was given the name 'Nelson' by his teacher, following the common practice of assigning English names to African students.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Activism</strong><br>\nMandela pursued higher education at the University College of Fort Hare but was expelled for joining a student protest. After leaving Fort Hare, he continued his education at the University of Witwatersrand, where he studied law. Mandela's experiences with racial discrimination during his school years played a significant role in his development as an activist. He joined the African National Congress (ANC) in 1943, determined to fight for racial equality in South Africa.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Apartheid System</strong><br>\nApartheid was a system of institutionalized racial segregation and discrimination in South Africa that began in 1948. Under apartheid, the rights of the majority black inhabitants were curtailed, and white supremacy and Afrikaner minority rule were maintained. Mandela became actively involved in the anti-apartheid movement, and his work with the ANC aimed to overthrow this unjust system.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
